We define `qPochInfPS R := (partitionGenFun R)⁻¹` (as a power series inverse,
which exists since the constant term of `partitionGenFun R` is 1, a unit).

This gives us `partitionGenFun R * qPochInfPS R = 1` algebraically. -/

